 Q 794 339 611 723 Q 429 1107 429 1638 Q 429 2138 573 2573 Q 717 3008 957 3373 Q 1197 3738 1475 4016 Q 1754 4294 2022 4467 L 2714 4467 Q 2240 4122 1897 3786 Q 1555 3450 1331 3059 Q 1107 2669 986 2150 L 1018 2138 Q 1126 2323 1270 2467 Q 1414 2611 1619 2694 Q 1824 2778 2093 2778 Q 2477 2778 2774 2611 Q 3072 2445 3241 2134 Q 3411 1824 3411 1402 Q 3411 966 3225 630 Q 3040 294 2707 108 Q 2374 -77 1926 -77 z\nM 1920 390 Q 2214 390 2422 499 Q 2630 608 2742 819 Q 2854 1030 2854 1331 L 2854 1382 Q 2854 1683 2742 1894 Q 2630 2106 2422 2214 Q 2214 2323 1920 2323 Q 1626 2323 1418 2214 Q 1210 2106 1098 1894 Q 986 1683 986 1382 L 986 1331 Q 986 1030 1098 819 Q 1210 608 1418 499 Q 1626 390 1920 390 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3b\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-40\" transform=\"translate(60 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-38\" transform=\"translate(120 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_13\"><g style=\"fill: #2d3748\" transform=\"translate(170.497225 76.12) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3b\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3c\" transform=\"translate(60 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-38\" transform=\"translate(120 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_14\"><g style=\"fill: #2d3748\" transform=\"translate(253.262775 15.4) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><defs><path id=\"IBMPlexSans-Regular-3e\" d=\"M 2912 0 L 2400 0 L 2400 877 L 243 877 L 243 1350 L 2112 4467 L 2912 4467 L 2912 1325 L 3558 1325 L 3558 877 L 2912 877 L 2912 0 z\nM 2368 4051 L 749 1325 L 2400 1325 L 2400 4051 L 2368 4051 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3c\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3e\" transform=\"translate(60 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-38\" transform=\"translate(120 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_15\"><g style=\"fill: #2d3748\" transform=\"translate(336.028325 15.4) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3c\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3e\" transform=\"translate(60 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-38\" transform=\"translate(120 0)\"/></g></g></g></g><defs><clipPath id=\"p6bf9a96d73\"><rect x=\"46.1\" y=\"11.528\" width=\"345.96\" height=\"127.512\"/></clipPath></defs></svg>\n","title":"Exhibit 1 · People per hour by station","note":null},"answer":"<p>Check-in: 4 × 60 ÷ 1.5 = 160. Screening: 6 × 60 ÷ 3 = <b>120</b>. Vaccination: 8 × 30 = 240. Observation: 60 chairs × 4 an hour = 240.</p> <p><b>Screening is the bottleneck</b> at 120 an hour.</p>"},{"q":"The manager wants more screening nurses. How many would be needed, and is there a cheaper way?","exhibit":null,"answer":"<p>For 200 an hour at 3 minutes each: 200 × 3 ÷ 60 = <b>10 nurses</b>, 4 more.</p> <p>Cheaper: ask people to complete health questions online. Average screening time: 70% × 1 + 30% × 3 = 1.6 minutes, so 6 nurses screen 225 an hour.</p> <p>But now <b>check-in (160 an hour) is the bottleneck</b>.</p>"},{"q":"How do you get to 200?","exhibit":{"kind":"table","headers":["Station","Today","+ online forms","+ one check-in desk"],"rows":[["Check-in","160","160","200"],["Screening","120","225","225"],["Vaccination","240","240","240"],["Observation","240","240","240"]],"title":"Exhibit 2 · Capacity per hour","note":null,"align":["l","r","r","r"],"boldLast":false},"answer":"<p>Add one check-in desk (5 desks: 200 an hour). Now every station handles at least 200: the slowest is check-in at 200.</p> <p>Total change: online forms plus one desk clerk, instead of four extra nurses. Check observation: at 200 an hour, 200 × 15 ÷ 60 = 50 people seated at once, within 60 chairs.</p>"}],"reco":"Reach 200 an hour by removing work rather than adding nurses. Screening limits the centre to 120 an hour; asking people to complete health questions online cuts screening time to about 1.6 minutes, lifting it to 225 an hour, and one extra check-in desk clears the next bottleneck, taking every station to at least 200. That needs one clerk instead of four extra nurses. Risk: fewer people complete forms online than expected, so keep two nurses on call. Next step: add the online form to the booking confirmation.","great":["Computes capacity for every station, including observation chairs","Finds the bottleneck and the next one","Prefers removing work to adding staff","Checks that every station meets the target"],"id":82,"slug":"lantern-vaccination-centre"}